# Services

Purpose
-------
Stores all services offered by a business.

Examples

- Haircut
- Beard Trim
- Hair Spa

Owner
-----
Business

Primary Key
-----------
id

Foreign Keys
------------
business_id → businesses.id

Used By
-------
